{
  "info": {
    "name": "DweLink - pharmacy-service",
    "description": "Tests manuels du microservice Gestion des pharmacies (port 8082).\nAuthentification par jeton JWT Keycloak (voir outils/keycloak/README.md) : lancer d'abord une requête du dossier « 0. Authentification » ; le jeton est enregistré dans {{token}} et envoyé en Authorization: Bearer {{token}} (auth définie au niveau de la collection). Chaque requête indique le jeton attendu.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082"
    },
    {
      "key": "keycloakUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8180"
    },
    {
      "key": "pharmacieId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "membreId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Authentification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtenir un token - pharmacien (PHARMACIEN, utilisateurId 100)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Jeton obtenu', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const jeton = pm.response.json().access_token;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jeton);",
                  "console.log('Jeton pharmacien enregistré dans {{token}}');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "dwelink-frontend"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "pharmacien"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "pharmacien"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/dwelink/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": [
                "{{keycloakUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "realms",
                "dwelink",
                "protocol",
                "openid-connect",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Enregistre le jeton de l'utilisateur pharmacien dans la variable {{token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtenir un token - admin (ADMIN, utilisateurId 900)",
